<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="design" version="24.7.17"><diagram id="p78433" name="01 System Context"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2095-2" value="&lt;b style='font-size:20px'&gt;FlameScope (working title) - System Context&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:12px;color:#555555'&gt;NASA Space Apps 2026 - Flame in Freefall: AI-powered dashboard that summarizes, ranks and interprets PSI combustion investigations for fire-safety insight&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1400" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-3" value="Users" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;dashed=1;arcSize=3;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="300" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Professors / students&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;learn, compare investigations" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="120" width="260" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-5" value="&lt;b&gt;Aerospace researchers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;find data for predictive models" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="200" width="260" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-6" value="&lt;b&gt;Habitat / spacecraft engineers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;fire-safety design decisions" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="280" width="260" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-7" value="&lt;b&gt;Earth fire-safety practitioners&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(challenge add-on)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="360" width="260" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-8" value="&lt;b style='font-size:16px'&gt;FlameScope&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Web dashboard + AI agents&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Identify investigations most relevant to crewed-habitat fire safety&lt;br&gt;2. Extract data that supports predictive flammability modeling&lt;br&gt;3. Highlight research informing next-gen fire-safety controls and equipment&lt;br&gt;+ Earth applications add-on" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#1f3a5f;strokeColor=#1f3a5f;fontColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="120" width="460" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-9" value="External sources and services" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;dashed=1;arcSize=3;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="80" width="400" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-10" value="&lt;b&gt;NASA PSI repository&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Combustion Science: 24 investigations, ~12 TB&lt;br&gt;overviews, data folders, documents" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="120" width="360" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-11" value="&lt;b&gt;PSI on AWS Registry of Open Data&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;bulk / programmatic object access" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="205" width="360" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-12" value="&lt;b&gt;Publications&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;DOIs, journal abstracts, NASA NTRS" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="275" width="360" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-13" value="&lt;b&gt;LLM + embedding endpoint&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;hosted API or self-hosted (llama.cpp / vLLM)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="345" width="360" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-14" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#444444;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.1000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2095-4" target="2095-8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-15" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#444444;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.3667;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2095-5" target="2095-8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-16" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#444444;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.6333;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2095-6" target="2095-8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-17" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#444444;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.9000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2095-7" target="2095-8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-18" value="harvest metadata, docs" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#444444;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.1167;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2095-8" target="2095-10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-19" value="selective data pull" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#444444;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.3733;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.4909;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2095-8" target="2095-11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-20" value="abstracts, citations" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#444444;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.6067;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.4909;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2095-8" target="2095-12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-21" value="extract, score, answer" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#444444;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.8400;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.4909;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2095-8" target="2095-13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-22" value="What the system produces" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;dashed=1;arcSize=3;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="520" width="1440" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-23" value="&lt;b&gt;Investigation cards&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;objectives, fuels, sample geometry, O2, pressure, flow, sensors, hardware" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="560" width="264" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-24" value="&lt;b&gt;Ranked lists&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;three relevance lenses with evidence and adjustable weights" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="344" y="560" width="264" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-25" value="&lt;b&gt;Comparisons&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;what was the same / different within and across investigations" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="628" y="560" width="264" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-26" value="&lt;b&gt;Model-ready extracts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CSV / JSON of test conditions and outcomes + source links" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="912" y="560" width="264" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-27" value="&lt;b&gt;Insight briefs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;cited answers, lunar-habitat scenario bounds, Earth spin-offs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1196" y="560" width="264" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2095-28" value="&lt;b&gt;Design stance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Curate knowledge from overviews, documents and publications (MBs), link out to raw data (TBs); never try to move 12 TB in a hackathon.&lt;br&gt;- Heavy AI work happens offline at ingestion; the dashboard reads pre-computed, human-checkable results. Live LLM calls only for Ask and Scenario explanations.&lt;br&gt;- Every score and statement carries evidence: a PSI link, document section or DOI." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=left;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="740" width="1440" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="p30784" name="02 Logical Architecture"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="255-2" value="&lt;b style='font-size:20px'&gt;Logical Architecture - layers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:12px;color:#555555'&gt;Top-down request path; ingestion runs offline and fills the data layer&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1400" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="255-3" value="Presentation - React SPA (Vite, TypeScript, charts)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;dashed=1;arcSize=3;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="70" width="1200" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="255-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Explorer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;cards + filters" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="108" width="132" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="255-5" value